{
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.49,
      "size": 55872,
      "text": "平面上有个漂亮的定理：任意两个面积相等的多边形，一定能把其中一个剪成有限块，再拼成另一个。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.41,
      "size": 70560,
      "text": "这叫波尔约-格温定理，一八三三年就证明了。三角形能剪成正方形，五角星能剪成圆的内接多边形，只要面积一样就行。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.93,
      "size": 62928,
      "text": "那么空间里呢？两个体积相等的多面体，是不是也一定能剪拼？希尔伯特一九零零年把这个问题列为第三问。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "answer",
      "line_id": "an-1",
      "filename": "answer-an-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/answer-an-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55296,
      "text": "同一年，希尔伯特的学生德恩就给出了答案：不能。等体积的正四面体和立方体，剪不成对方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "answer",
      "line_id": "an-2",
      "filename": "answer-an-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/answer-an-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "size": 44928,
      "text": "这是希尔伯特二十三个问题里最早被解决的一个，从提出到解决只隔了几个月。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "answer",
      "line_id": "an-3",
      "filename": "answer-an-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/answer-an-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.36,
      "size": 53712,
      "text": "德恩的办法是造一个量，无论怎么切割重组它都不变。如果两个立体的这个量不同，就一定剪不成。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "construct",
      "line_id": "cs-1",
      "filename": "construct-cs-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/construct-cs-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "德恩不变量的形式是：把每条棱的长度与它的二面角配成一对，全部加起来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "construct",
      "line_id": "cs-2",
      "filename": "construct-cs-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/construct-cs-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.95,
      "size": 47232,
      "text": "关键在于这个加法发生在一个特殊的空间里，那里所有圆周率的有理倍数都被当成零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "construct",
      "line_id": "cs-3",
      "filename": "construct-cs-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/construct-cs-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.89,
      "size": 62208,
      "text": "这意味着：如果一条棱的二面角是圆周率的有理倍数，它对不变量的贡献就是零。屏幕上绿色的棱就是这种。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "cube",
      "line_id": "cb-1",
      "filename": "cube-cb-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/cube-cb-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.23,
      "size": 51696,
      "text": "看立方体。它十二条棱的二面角全是九十度，也就是圆周率的二分之一，是有理倍数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "cube",
      "line_id": "cb-2",
      "filename": "cube-cb-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/cube-cb-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.1,
      "size": 49536,
      "text": "所以每一项都归零，整个德恩不变量等于零。屏幕右上角的判定显示等于零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "cube",
      "line_id": "cb-3",
      "filename": "cube-cb-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/cube-cb-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.08,
      "size": 65232,
      "text": "再看正三棱柱。它有两种二面角，六十度和九十度，都是有理倍数，所以也是零。这两个立体之间就没有障碍。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "tetra",
      "line_id": "tt-1",
      "filename": "tetra-tt-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/tetra-tt-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.68,
      "size": 42912,
      "text": "请切到正四面体。它的二面角是三分之一的反余弦，约七十点五三度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "tetra",
      "line_id": "tt-2",
      "filename": "tetra-tt-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/tetra-tt-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.91,
      "size": 62496,
      "text": "这个角与圆周率不可通约，也就是它除以圆周率是个无理数。所以这一项不归零，德恩不变量不等于零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "tetra",
      "line_id": "tt-3",
      "filename": "tetra-tt-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/tetra-tt-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.9,
      "size": 62352,
      "text": "于是结论出来了：立方体的不变量是零，正四面体不是零，两者不同，所以无论体积是否相等，都剪不成对方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "irrational",
      "line_id": "ir-1",
      "filename": "irrational-ir-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/irrational-ir-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.35,
      "size": 37584,
      "text": "关键一步是证明那个角与圆周率不可通约。这里用尼文的办法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "irrational",
      "line_id": "ir-2",
      "filename": "irrational-ir-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/irrational-ir-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.85,
      "size": 61632,
      "text": "设余弦值是三分之一，用倍角递推可以证明：三的 n 次方乘以 n 倍角的余弦，永远是个不被三整除的整数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "irrational",
      "line_id": "ir-3",
      "filename": "irrational-ir-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/irrational-ir-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.9,
      "size": 94464,
      "text": "如果这个角是圆周率的有理倍数，余弦值就会循环，迟早出现零或者正负二分之一，那时分子必然被三整除。矛盾。屏幕上列出了前几项，确实都不被三整除。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "sydler",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "sydler-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/sydler-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.05,
      "size": 48816,
      "text": "第一，平面上等面积必可剪拼，但空间里等体积不够，这是希尔伯特第三问题的答案。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "sydler",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "sydler-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/sydler-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.27,
      "size": 52272,
      "text": "第二，德恩不变量把棱长与二面角配对求和，二面角是圆周率有理倍数的项自动归零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dehn-invariant",
      "section_id": "sydler",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "sydler-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dehn-invariant/xiaoxiao/sydler-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.57,
      "size": 73152,
      "text": "第三，一九六五年西德勒证明了反过来也成立：体积相等加上德恩不变量相等，就一定能剪拼。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
